{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"High‑level Unity bridge for macOS dialog presentation built on top of "},{"code":"MacLibrary","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"UnityMacPlugin"}],"title":"`UnityMacPlugin`","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnityMacPlugin"},{"text":" exposes the dialog and file panel functionality implemented in the Swift","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacLibrary\/MacDialogManager"},{"text":" to Unity (C#) or other native layers through a thin","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Objective‑C \/ C bridge. It handles:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Alert dialogs (","type":"text"},{"code":"UnityMacDialogManager\/showDialog(title:message:buttonsJson:optionsJson:completion:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Single & multi file pickers (open panels)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Single & multi folder pickers","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Save file dialogs","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Suppression checkbox state reporting","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"JSON → Swift option translation for alert configuration","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Safe marshaling of results back to Unity via C function callbacks","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Architecture","anchor":"Architecture"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnityMacDialogManager"},{"text":" wraps ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacLibrary\/MacDialogManager"},{"text":" and converts strongly typed Swift ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Result"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"completions into Objective‑C friendly ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"(NSDictionary?, NSError?)"},{"text":" callbacks. The C bridge functions","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(defined in ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"UnityMacDialogManagerBridge.h \/ .m","type":"text"}]},{"text":") further flatten those into plain C primitives so they can be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consumed with P\/Invoke (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[DllImport(\"__Internal\")]"},{"text":") from Unity C# code. A managed helper (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacDialogManager"},{"text":" C# MonoBehaviour)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exposes idiomatic events, performs marshaling, and handles memory cleanup.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Layering:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["Unity C# (MacDialogManager.cs)","   ↓ (P\/Invoke \/ DllImport)","C Bridge (UnityMacDialogManagerBridge.*)","   ↓ (Objective‑C → Swift)","UnityMacDialogManager (Swift facade)","   ↓","MacDialogManager (Core logic)","   ↓","AppKit (NSAlert \/ NSOpenPanel \/ NSSavePanel)"]},{"level":3,"text":"Result Dictionaries","anchor":"Result-Dictionaries","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each dialog type returns a dictionary with well‑defined keys (all values are Foundation bridged types):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dialog Type"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keys"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Alert"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"buttonTitle:String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"buttonIndex:Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"suppressionButtonState:Bool"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"File \/ MultiFile \/ Folder \/ MultiFolder"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"filePaths:[String]"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fileCount:Int"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"directoryURL:String"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isCancelled:Bool"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isSuccess:Bool"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Save"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"filePath:String","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"fileCount:Int","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"directoryURL:String","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isCancelled:Bool"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isSuccess:Bool"}]}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Error cases provide an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSError"},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"localizedDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" mirrors "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacLibrary\/DialogError"},{"type":"text","text":" text."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Cancellation Semantics","anchor":"Cancellation-Semantics","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cancellation is reported as "},{"code":"isCancelled == true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" while still treating the operation as logically successful (","type":"text"},{"code":"isSuccess == true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")—it is a user choice, not a failure. Runtime issues (configuration errors, unexpected failures) set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isSuccess == false"},{"type":"text","text":" and provide an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSError"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"text":"Alert JSON Schema","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Alert-JSON-Schema"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"buttonsJson"},{"text":" example:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"json","type":"codeListing","code":["{","  \"buttons\": [","    { \"title\": \"OK\", \"isDefault\": true, \"keyEquivalent\": \"\" },","    { \"title\": \"Cancel\" }","  ]","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"optionsJson","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" example:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"json","code":["{","  \"alertStyle\": \"warning\",","  \"showsSuppressionButton\": true,","  \"suppressionButtonTitle\": \"Do not show again\"","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"alertStyle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" accepts: ","type":"text"},{"code":"informational","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" | ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"warning"},{"type":"text","text":" | "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"critical"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"File--Folder-Selection","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"File & Folder Selection"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"File filters are passed as an array of filename extensions (no leading dot) and converted to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UTType"},{"type":"text","text":"s in Swift. Folder dialogs disable file selection flags and invert selection logic accordingly."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Save Panel","anchor":"Save-Panel","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The save dialog returns a single path. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fileCount"},{"type":"text","text":" remains for structural symmetry (1 on success, 0 if cancelled)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Threading","anchor":"Threading","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All public functions are safe to call from any thread. UI work is dispatched onto the main queue by the underlying manager. The C# wrapper enqueues callbacks back to Unity’s main thread (via a dispatcher) before firing events.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Memory--Lifetime-Notes","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Memory & Lifetime Notes"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"C callback string pointers reference autoreleased NSStrings valid only during the execution of the callback. The Unity C# wrapper copies them ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Marshal.PtrToStringUTF8"},{"type":"text","text":") into managed strings immediately. Caller code only receives safe managed data."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"anchor":"Unity-C-Wrapper-MacDialogManagercs","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Unity C# Wrapper (MacDialogManager.cs)"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The provided sample ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacDialogManager"},{"text":" MonoBehaviour offers:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Lazy singleton creation (","type":"text"},{"code":"Instance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property); object is marked ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DontDestroyOnLoad"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Event-based result delivery for each dialog type:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AlertDialogResult(string? buttonTitle, int buttonIndex, bool suppressionState, bool isSuccess, string? errorMessage)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileDialogResult(string[]? filePaths, int fileCount, string? directoryURL, bool isCancelled, bool isSuccess, string? errorMessage)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiFileDialogResult(…)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FolderDialogResult(…)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiFolderDialogResult(…)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SaveFileDialogResult(string? filePath, int fileCount, string? directoryURL, bool isCancelled, bool isSuccess, string? errorMessage)"}]}]}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Validation (title, buttons\/options presence) with early error event emission.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Explicit unmanaged memory allocation & guaranteed release inside callback (even on error) for content type arrays.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Main‑thread dispatch for all event invocations.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"C-Alert-Usage","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"C# Alert Usage"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"csharp","code":["var buttons = new [] {","    new DialogButton { title = \"OK\", isDefault = true },","    new DialogButton { title = \"Cancel\" }","};","var options = new DialogOptions { alertStyle = \"informational\", showsSuppressionButton = true, suppressionButtonTitle = \"Do not show again\" };","MacDialogManager.Instance.AlertDialogResult += (title, index, suppression, success, err) => {","    if (success) Debug.Log($\"Pressed {title} (index {index}) suppression={suppression}\");","    else Debug.LogError(err);","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowDialog(\"Example\", \"Choose an option\", buttons, options);"]},{"anchor":"C-Single-File-Dialog","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"C# Single File Dialog"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"csharp","code":["MacDialogManager.Instance.FileDialogResult += (paths, count, dir, cancelled, success, err) => {","    if (!success) { Debug.LogError(err); return; }","    if (cancelled) Debug.Log(\"User cancelled\"); else Debug.Log(string.Join(\"\\n\", paths));","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowFileDialog(\"Select File\", \"Pick a single file\", new [] { \"txt\", \"md\" });"]},{"anchor":"C-Multi-File-Dialog","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"C# Multi File Dialog"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"csharp","code":["MacDialogManager.Instance.MultiFileDialogResult += (paths, count, dir, cancelled, success, err) => {","    if (success && !cancelled) Debug.Log($\"Selected {count} files\");","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowMultiFileDialog(\"Select Files\", \"Choose multiple\", new [] { \"png\", \"jpg\" });"]},{"anchor":"C-Folder--Multi-Folder","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"C# Folder & Multi Folder"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"csharp","code":["MacDialogManager.Instance.FolderDialogResult += (paths, count, dir, cancelled, success, err) => {","    if (success && !cancelled) Debug.Log($\"Folder: {paths?[0]}\");","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowFolderDialog(\"Select Folder\", \"Choose a folder\");","","MacDialogManager.Instance.MultiFolderDialogResult += (paths, count, dir, cancelled, success, err) => {","    if (success && !cancelled) Debug.Log($\"Folders: {string.Join(\", \", paths ?? Array.Empty<string>())}\");","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowMultiFolderDialog(\"Select Folders\", \"Choose multiple folders\");"]},{"anchor":"C-Save-File-Dialog","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"C# Save File Dialog"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"csharp","code":["MacDialogManager.Instance.SaveFileDialogResult += (path, count, dir, cancelled, success, err) => {","    if (success && !cancelled) Debug.Log($\"Save path: {path}\");","};","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowSaveFileDialog(\"Save File\", \"Provide a location\", \"sample.txt\", new [] { \"txt\" });"]},{"anchor":"Events-Lifecycle-Notes","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Events Lifecycle Notes"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Subscribe ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}]},{"text":" invoking the corresponding ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Show*"},{"text":" method to avoid race conditions if a dialog closes quickly (rare but possible).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unsubscribe when no longer needed to avoid memory leaks in long‑running editor sessions.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Multiple listeners are supported; each is invoked sequentially.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"anchor":"C-Bridge-Mapping","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"C Bridge Mapping"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"C Function"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"C# DllImport Signature (Simplified)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Managed Invoke Method"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Result Event"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"showDialog"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"void showDialog(string,string,string,string,DialogCallback)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ShowDialog(...)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AlertDialogResult","type":"codeVoice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"showFileDialog"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"void showFileDialog(string,string,IntPtr,int,string,FileDialogCallback)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ShowFileDialog(...)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FileDialogResult"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"showMultiFileDialog"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"void showMultiFileDialog(string,string,IntPtr,int,string,MultiFileDialogCallback)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ShowMultiFileDialog(...)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiFileDialogResult"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"showFolderDialog"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"void showFolderDialog(string,string,string,FolderDialogCallback)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ShowFolderDialog(...)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FolderDialogResult"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"showMultiFolderDialog"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"void showMultiFolderDialog(string,string,string,MultiFolderDialogCallback)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ShowMultiFolderDialog(...)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiFolderDialogResult"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"showSaveFileDialog"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"void showSaveFileDialog(string,string,string,IntPtr,int,string,SaveFileDialogCallback)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ShowSaveFileDialog(...)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SaveFileDialogResult"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"anchor":"Memory-Safety-in-C-Wrapper","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Memory Safety in C# Wrapper"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"string[] allowedContentTypes"},{"type":"text","text":" element is marshalled as an individual unmanaged UTF‑8 buffer + NULL terminator."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A contiguous pointer array is allocated and passed to the C bridge."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cleanup occurs inside the callback’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finally"},{"type":"text","text":" block after the Unity main thread event dispatch, ensuring no premature free."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On exceptions during setup, allocated buffers are freed before emitting an error event."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Error-Patterns","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Error Patterns"},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Condition","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Emitted Event Values","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Notes","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Empty title","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"buttonIndex \/ fileCount = -1"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isSuccess=false"},{"text":", error message populated","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Validation short‑circuit","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No buttons (alert)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"buttonIndex = -1"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isSuccess=false"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DialogError.noButtons"},{"type":"text","text":" equivalent"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"User cancel (panel)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isCancelled=true"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isSuccess=true"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"