:[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Extend ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacLibrary\/MacDialogManager"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add a Swift bridging method in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnityMacDialogManager"},{"type":"text","text":" that flattens the result to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSDictionary"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a C bridge function + C typedef."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Notification Bridge","anchor":"Notification-Bridge"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnityMacNotificationManager"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UnityMacNotificationJsonParser"}]}]}]},{"start":4,"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Extend ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MacDialogManager.cs"},{"text":" with DllImport, delegate, event, and a public ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Show*"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Update this document & provide new C# usage examples.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Quick Start (Unity C#)","anchor":"Quick-Start-Unity-C"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"(See expanded examples above.) Minimal alert recap:"}]},{"syntax":"csharp","type":"codeListing","code":["MacDialogManager.Instance.AlertDialogResult += (t,i,s,ok,err)=>Debug.Log($\"Pressed {t} idx={i} ok={ok}\");","MacDialogManager.Instance.ShowDialog(","    \"Hello\",","    \"From Unity\",","    new[]{ new DialogButton{ title=\"OK\", isDefault=true }, new DialogButton{ title=\"Cancel\" } },","    new DialogOptions{ alertStyle=\"informational\" }",")